<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-08T14:24:39.936Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 14:24:39 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits in Zamfara have locked families inside rooms and set them ablaze, killing multiple members and abducting others, while similar attacks have burned families alive and killed dozens in the same state. In Asaba, a march resulted in one death and five injuries, and a political rally in Delta saw supporters assaulted and a 50‑year-old man killed and his body burned in a Nasarawa well. A truck overturned in Lagos, killing a passenger, and a separate road crash in Ogun caused three deaths and seven injuries. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQeWxRTU5WYjNxS2hMWHZiZjRLRTB6VDdyS3BuMWFrX2hnRmMxVVc4b1p5bDJlaEE2alBLMVNZME1EY25BS2YtOE1nNXlWNEVMTTdlQm5jUWdsZXFjZlRiYnpBdmVKQlpaZklRdG9SOUFTa1BvZ3p5eHlFSnEzM1ZCMlBHSE11SlotUUdpcS1vSEw3bG11?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNb0daU2lEOEo3TnEwb0tnR3RzTWFIR0hic29YVEJLaTBMS1g3NG50dTFpZXAxV3ZZamdqa1Zxc0pnTWFsYU5wVkV4MF9Hd05pa3dMZ2owRWw5RDNJeHlsWjcxa192UklQTV9FVUhlRF9TMlh6RzdCTXZsZ2hScmVYd2swNjFYM0R4T2wxSEh4NFRRTXFuUkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;FRCN HQ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPTzkzakVTMTA0emFaQWlrSTZ0eFhJZ2pyNnZpcExXbEpzbDVVdUdjS1BHUnJvbHBTUzBZOG1jQ3NIT3l6TXNhTnFyM09HT090ZTZRTGN2UE81UU53WFJBMkxsTUNtZnBjX3hiNlZOcENPVlk2UzhJU0VXTDZiN2E0Q29wZnA5MDk3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Trust&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQMmVIQnVmemIwMFZXRlVGWVVNT3dOZ1ptcm1yaFNXNTVMbF9EV01Oa0EzVEduc2FpUGhpY1NFVjVuVGhDTkxIOWRtWVFQd201SUZuV1hLQmhOOS01Ti1KQU1FeW1hM3hxMnd0alh2SDRDR0FZU3pmMVdWeVdWQ1AteXRaSng5WVhMZVFibzUtcGR6VGllMkxPQXh6QXNXdnpWSmk5bE9RUzM?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/ar